{"version": 1, "note": "Structure from VP-08 (project) with taali/khali from two cited web pages; thekas are marked by source. Verify with your guru.", "symbols": [{"sym": "×", "meaning": "सम (ताली)"}, {"sym": "2, 3, 4", "meaning": "ताली — क्रम-संख्या (भातखंडे)"}, {"sym": "0", "meaning": "खाली"}, {"sym": "|", "meaning": "विभाग की रेखा"}], "taals": [{"id": "teentaal", "name_deva": "तीनताल (त्रिताल)", "name_en": "Teentaal (Tritaal)", "matras": 16, "vibhag": "4+4+4+4", "padvarg": "समपदी", "padvarg_note": "", "sam": 1, "taali": [1, 5, 13], "khali": [9], "theka_deva": "धा धिं धिं धा | धा धिं धिं धा | धा तिं तिं ता | ता धिं धिं धा", "theka_marks": "×  ·  ·  ·  |  2  ·  ·  ·  |  0  ·  ·  ·  |  3  ·  ·  ·", "theka_src": "project: VP-04 (Bhatkhande marks)", "flags": ["Two web sources write the last line as \"na dhin dhin dha\" (ना), while your VP-04 writes \"ता धिं धिं धा\". Write what your guru/paper key uses; your notes (ता) come first."], "sources": [{"label": "VP-04 (written Teentaal)"}, {"label": "VP-08 (taal table)"}, {"label": "ancient-future.com: North Indian Talas", "url": "https://ancient-future.com/theka.html"}, {"label": "Gangolli (U. Washington): Thekas", "url": "https://sites.math.washington.edu/~gangolli/Music428Thekas.html"}], "anchor": "teentaaltritaal"}, {"id": "tilwada", "name_deva": "तिलवाड़ा", "name_en": "Tilwada", "matras": 16, "vibhag": "4+4+4+4", "padvarg": "समपदी", "padvarg_note": "", "sam": 1, "taali": null, "khali": null, "theka_deva": "", "theka_marks": "", "theka_src": "", "flags": ["Your TAAL AND THEKA note says Tilwada uses the same vibhag as Teentaal; taali/khali marks and theka are not written in your notes. Get them from your guru."], "sources": [{"label": "VP-08 (taal table)"}, {"label": "TAAL AND THEKA (notes)"}], "anchor": "tilwada"}, {"id": "ektaal", "name_deva": "एकताल", "name_en": "Ektaal", "matras": 12, "vibhag": "2+2+2+2+2+2", "padvarg": "समपदी", "padvarg_note": "", "sam": 1, "taali": [1, 5, 9, 11], "khali": [3, 7], "theka_web": "Dhin dhin | dhage terekite | tun na | kat ta | dhage terekite | dhin na", "theka_src": "web (one published version): Gangolli", "flags": ["Sources differ on grouping and marks: one gives 2+2+2+2+2+2 with khali at 3 and 7 (used here, matches VP-08); another gives 4-4-4 with khali at 7. Confirm with your guru."], "sources": [{"label": "VP-08 (taal table)"}, {"label": "ancient-future.com: North Indian Talas", "url": "https://ancient-future.com/theka.html"}, {"label": "Gangolli (U. Washington): Thekas", "url": "https://sites.math.washington.edu/~gangolli/Music428Thekas.html"}], "anchor": "ektaal"}, {"id": "chautaal", "name_deva": "चौताल", "name_en": "Chautaal", "matras": 12, "vibhag": "2+2+2+2+2+2", "padvarg": "समपदी", "padvarg_note": "", "sam": 1, "taali": [1, 5, 9, 11], "khali": [3, 7], "theka_web": "Dha dha dhin ta | tete dha din ta | tete kata | gadi gana", "theka_src": "web (one published version): Gangolli (groups it 4-4-2-2)", "flags": ["The published theka groups the 12 beats as 4-4-2-2, but VP-08 and the other web page give 2+2+2+2+2+2. Marks here follow VP-08. Confirm with your guru."], "sources": [{"label": "VP-08 (taal table)"}, {"label": "ancient-future.com: North Indian Talas", "url": "https://ancient-future.com/theka.html"}, {"label": "Gangolli (U. Washington): Thekas", "url": "https://sites.math.washington.edu/~gangolli/Music428Thekas.html"}], "anchor": "chautaal"}, {"id": "jhaptaal", "name_deva": "झपताल", "name_en": "Jhaptaal", "matras": 10, "vibhag": "2+3+2+3", "padvarg": "अर्धसमपदी", "padvarg_note": "पत्र-पक्का (दो पत्रों में)", "sam": 1, "taali": [1, 3, 8], "khali": [6], "theka_web": "Dhin na | dhin dhin na | tin na | dhin dhin na", "theka_src": "web (one published version): Gangolli", "flags": [], "sources": [{"label": "VP-08 (taal table)"}, {"label": "ancient-future.com: North Indian Talas", "url": "https://ancient-future.com/theka.html"}, {"label": "Gangolli (U. Washington): Thekas", "url": "https://sites.math.washington.edu/~gangolli/Music428Thekas.html"}], "anchor": "jhaptaal"}, {"id": "rupak", "name_deva": "रूपक (तेवरा)", "name_en": "Rupak (Tevra)", "matras": 7, "vibhag": "3+2+2", "padvarg": "अर्धसमपदी*", "padvarg_note": "VP-08 में borderline ⚑; VP-01 §7 इसे विषमपदी कहता है", "sam": 1, "taali": [4, 6], "khali": [1], "theka_web": "Tin tin na | dhin na | dhin na", "theka_src": "web (two sources agree)", "flags": ["Padvarg conflict inside your own notes: VP-08 puts Rupak/Tevra under अर्धसमपदी (borderline ⚑), VP-01 §7 lists Rupak under विषमपदी. Follow the paper key.", "In Rupak the sam is a khali beat (written 0). Tevra is a different taal in some schools (all-taali, \"Dha din ta | teta kata | gadi gana\"); your VP-08 lists them together."], "sources": [{"label": "VP-08 (taal table)"}, {"label": "VP-01 §7"}, {"label": "ancient-future.com: North Indian Talas", "url": "https://ancient-future.com/theka.html"}, {"label": "Gangolli (U. Washington): Thekas", "url": "https://sites.math.washington.edu/~gangolli/Music428Thekas.html"}], "anchor": "rupaktevra"}, {"id": "deepchandi", "name_deva": "दीपचंदी", "name_en": "Deepchandi", "matras": 14, "vibhag": "3+4+3+4", "padvarg": "अर्धसमपदी*", "padvarg_note": "VP-08: एक पत्र \"विषमपदी\" कहता है ⚑", "sam": 1, "taali": [1, 4, 11], "khali": [8], "theka_web": "dha dhin - | dha dha tin - | ta tin - | dha dha dhin -", "theka_src": "web (one published version): Gangolli", "flags": ["Padvarg: VP-08 says अर्धसमपदी by structure but one paper calls it विषमपदी (your VP-08 ⚑ flag a). Follow the paper key."], "sources": [{"label": "VP-08 (taal table)"}, {"label": "Gangolli (U. Washington): Thekas", "url": "https://sites.math.washington.edu/~gangolli/Music428Thekas.html"}], "anchor": "deepchandi"}, {"id": "dhamar", "name_deva": "धमार", "name_en": "Dhamar", "matras": 14, "vibhag": "5+2+3+4", "padvarg": "विषमपदी", "padvarg_note": "पत्र-पक्का", "sam": 1, "taali": [1, 6, 11], "khali": [8], "theka_web": "", "theka_src": "", "flags": ["Theka not given here: the web versions are unclear. Get it from your guru or from the model answers."], "sources": [{"label": "VP-08 (taal table)"}, {"label": "ancient-future.com: North Indian Talas", "url": "https://ancient-future.com/theka.html"}], "anchor": "dhamar"}, {"id": "dadra", "name_deva": "दादरा", "name_en": "Dadra", "matras": 6, "vibhag": "3+3", "padvarg": "", "padvarg_note": "", "sam": 1, "taali": [1], "khali": [4], "theka_web": "", "theka_src": "", "flags": ["Theka not given: the two web sources write it differently. Your VP-13 lists Dadra for ghazal, geet and qawwali."], "sources": [{"label": "ancient-future.com: North Indian Talas", "url": "https://ancient-future.com/theka.html"}, {"label": "Gangolli (U. Washington): Thekas", "url": "https://sites.math.washington.edu/~gangolli/Music428Thekas.html"}, {"label": "VP-13 (accompaniment)"}], "anchor": "dadra"}, {"id": "kaharwa", "name_deva": "कहरवा", "name_en": "Kaharwa", "matras": 8, "vibhag": "4+4", "padvarg": "", "padvarg_note": "", "sam": 1, "taali": [1], "khali": [5], "theka_web": "dha ge na ti | na ka dhi na", "theka_src": "web (one published version): ancient-future.com", "flags": ["Variants exist (bhajani keherwa, dhumali). Your VP-13 lists Kaharwa for ghazal, geet and qawwali."], "sources": [{"label": "ancient-future.com: North Indian Talas", "url": "https://ancient-future.com/theka.html"}, {"label": "Gangolli (U. Washington): Thekas", "url": "https://sites.math.washington.edu/~gangolli/Music428Thekas.html"}, {"label": "VP-13 (accompaniment)"}], "anchor": "kaharwa"}]}